--- !u!1001 &720621183
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4613828026226185999, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "A divorced doctor who spends his life saving others, always at work
        neglecting his family. His wife and son leave him to live on their own. \n\nAt
        nights he drinks to numb the pain of being left alone and tries to forget
        his regrets. Makes an attempt to reconnect with his estranged son, they are
        supposed to go on a trip, but he has drank beforehand to make it easier to
        talk to his son. In a car accident, he barely survives on the way home to
        his mansion (rich doctor who works all the time) where he lives alone, but
        his son doesn\u2019t survive. The one life he cared about the most he couldn\u2019t
        save. \n\nHe gets into the occult arts to try to understand why even he who
        had helped others cheat death couldn\u2019t do it when it truly mattered.
        (goes insane as one would)\nOne night he decides to not stop drinking, and
        passes out. (game starts)\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
