--- !u!1001 &1350502603857056403
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4613828026226185999, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "I won\u2019t let your judgement imprison the few pieces that remain
        of who I once was. Whisper your shallow pity if you must. Fear the tragic
        alleyway that led my soul to fracture or pretend that you understand, it
        has no consequence. I alone dictate what remains behind in these final moments.
        Feed your superstitions with whatever filth spills from your corrupted minds,
        but know this, the truth is mine to command. \n\nMy name is * and I killed
        them. Fragile lives held in the palms of my hands through all my life, all
        of them saved just to relinquish the one that mattered most. That is why
        I killed them. It was my spiral of despair. It should have been me, yet it
        claimed the life of another. Another whose life was mine to protect.\n\nI
        write not from a position of weakness but from one of power. The path I chose
        was my own and I alone choose where it ends. The blood of my actions stains
        the hands of those who kept me from what I loved. The only regret I bear
        is failing to keep the darkness from my boy. \n\nI will not be your prisoner.
        I am my own master."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544921937658798171, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Note
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7918184567583402636, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Pivot.x
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7918184567583402636, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Pivot.y
      value: 0.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7918184567583402636, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
